      "pipeline": {
        "importerVersion": "template-4.2",
        "platform": "web",
        "sourceHash": "52d5f329f384a83bb74ff8f984933a8753aaf48908c4d9b0caa042523042a728",
        "artifactHash": "52d5f329f384a83bb74ff8f984933a8753aaf48908c4d9b0caa042523042a728",
        "contentHash": "52d5f329f384a83bb74ff8f984933a8753aaf48908c4d9b0caa042523042a728",
        "cacheKey": "52d5f329f384a83bb74ff8f984933a8753aaf48908c4d9b0caa042523042a728",
        "status": "ready",
        "lastValidSource": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: coin-trail\n---\n# Coin Trail\n\nCollect six checkpoints in order. A gentle keyboard game with scoring, completion, and restart.\n\nWASD / arrow keys move. Collect the green checkpoint; the next appears after collection. Avoid pink circles. R restarts, including after a win or loss.\n\n## Edit and verify\n\nSelect named objects in Scene and change one component at a time. Play checks runtime behavior; Stop restores authored values. Save, reopen, and use Manage → Build to verify persistence and export. These are small complete checkpoint games; edit CheckpointGame.rhai to change course rules. All movement and hit tests use world units.\n\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPlay: WASD or arrow keys to move; R restarts. Collect the highlighted checkpoints in order and avoid red hazards.\n\n### Expected result\n\nThe HUD counts 6 checkpoints and shows a finish state. No time limit.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline · Keyboard\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay: WASD oder Pfeiltasten bewegen, R startet neu. Markierte Checkpoints der Reihe nach sammeln und roten Gefahren ausweichen.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nDas HUD zählt 6 Checkpoints und zeigt den Abschluss. Ohne Zeitlimit.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit · Tastatur\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n播放后用 WASD 或方向键移动，R 重开。按顺序收集高亮检查点，避开红色障碍。\n\n### 预期结果\n\nHUD 记录 6 个检查点并显示完成状态。无时间限制。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用 · 键盘\n",
        "error": "",
        "dependencies": [],
        "reverseDependencies": [],
        "cacheHit": false
      }
    },
    {
      "uuid": "01111354-73b7-4308-8111-135473b7f308",
      "name": "CheckpointGame.rhai",
      "path": "Assets/Scripts/CheckpointGame.rhai",
      "assetType": "script",
      "mimeType": "text/x-rhai",
      "byteLength": 2190,
      "source": "// @nova-graph-link 58145727-fc14-4920-af59-b64681e7ef20\n// Rhai structure IR 1: code and typed nodes share the same program.\n@export(type=\"int\", min=0, max=8, group=\"Runtime\") let checkpoint = 0;\n@export(type=\"float\", min=0, max=10000, group=\"Runtime\") let elapsed = 0.0;\n@export(type=\"bool\", group=\"Runtime\") let finished = false;\nfn start() { \n  checkpoint = 0; elapsed = 0.0; finished = false; score_set(0.0); set_position(-7.5, -4.0);\n  for index in 0..6 { entity_set_enabled(find_entity_handle(\"Checkpoint \" + (index + 1)), index == 0); }\n  ui_set_text_on(find_entity_handle(\"Scene Title\"), \"Coin Trail | Checkpoint 1/6 | WASD / arrows | R restart\"); }\nfn update(dt) {\n  if input_pressed(\"Restart\") { \n  checkpoint = 0; elapsed = 0.0; finished = false; score_set(0.0); set_position(-7.5, -4.0);\n  for index in 0..6 { entity_set_enabled(find_entity_handle(\"Checkpoint \" + (index + 1)), index == 0); }\n  ui_set_text_on(find_entity_handle(\"Scene Title\"), \"Coin Trail | Checkpoint 1/6 | WASD / arrows | R restart\"); return; }\n  if finished { return; }\n  elapsed += dt;\n  let pose = transform();\n  let mx = input_axis(\"MoveHorizontal\"); let my = input_axis(\"MoveVertical\");\n  if mx != 0.0 && my != 0.0 { mx *= 0.7071067811865476; my *= 0.7071067811865476; }\n  let x = pose.position_x + mx * 6.0 * dt;\n  let y = pose.position_y + my * 6.0 * dt;\n  if x < -8.0 { x = -8.0; } else if x > 8.0 { x = 8.0; }\n  if y < -4.5 { y = -4.5; } else if y > 4.5 { y = 4.5; }\n  set_position(x, y);\n  \n  \n  let xs = [-6.0, -3.0, 0.0, 3.0, 6.0, 0.0]; let ys = [-2.0, 1.0, 3.0, 1.0, -2.0, -3.0];\n  let dx = x - xs[checkpoint]; let dy = y - ys[checkpoint];\n  if dx * dx + dy * dy < 0.64 {\n    entity_set_enabled(find_entity_handle(\"Checkpoint \" + (checkpoint + 1)), false);\n    checkpoint += 1; score_add(1.0);\n    if checkpoint == 6 { finished = true; ui_set_text_on(find_entity_handle(\"Scene Title\"), \"Course complete! | R to restart\"); }\n    else { entity_set_enabled(find_entity_handle(\"Checkpoint \" + (checkpoint + 1)), true); }\n  }\n  if !finished { ui_set_text_on(find_entity_handle(\"Scene Title\"), \"Coin Trail | Checkpoint \" + (checkpoint + 1) + \"/6 | elapsed \" + elapsed.to_int() + \"s | R restart\"); }\n}",
